        '3-5', $q$Our Class Book Swap$q$, $q$(1) Our class held a book swap so we could share stories with each other. (2) Each student brought one or two books from home that they had already read. (3) ____, Malik brought a mystery about a missing dog, and Sofia brought a book of jokes. (4) We set all the books on long tables in the library. (5) Then each student got one ticket for every book they brought. (6) Students traded their tickets for new books to take home.

(7) The swap was a big success. (8) Almost everyone found a book they were excited to read. (9) We also had some extra books left over. (10) We gave those to the children's room at the town library. (11) Our school lunch on Friday was pizza. (12) Next year, we hope to invite the whole school to join.$q$, 'draft')
